d": "5448030711940983", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982466_5448030718607649_6845811233407644525_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wrgg6B3Z-HcQ7kNvwEAF0Ub&_nc_oc=Adp41UMwkEp4Ui7FQkbOZH41LliKZiZvUBjHMUWO_Dva2oIevmb3_jKR7XZBubl7Fdg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9Ucm27VoFD_EmG5zFUrV-huWb9_u_5nts3Wl83VjfG8g&oe=6A394240"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "1096947547603539", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974819_1096947550936872_6623262552815231899_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gzvHI1Y-Jd8Q7kNvwHBmNjB&_nc_oc=AdoVIizFOwwSMAyZNTy_kSMVy-MBUhCPmce21ijzApLTlQ6hAl18nTEEnqQwcqPkHFU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9PoDHXqbur5IKCTBn6F0-SkagRAOxQKw0qy6wAdPsIVQ&oe=6A39354D"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "492042612309514", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610702_492042615642847_8961521301303806226_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N79WzvrkR3EQ7kNvwGS6MFV&_nc_oc=Ador5LKF_PwWlTCnOFcW0tM61zqdkDv6xQ6iqvec1ozvZSOz43T41vp_wblL2HQMZNk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_HQLsvjwFpvtwUoi72YfwxQv7hoAwKIOSzwYwYVxz9mg&oe=6A39452C"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "831736571156653", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035344_831736577823319_3749544078509164249_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i8DnCbD9UScQ7kNvwGC_8M-&_nc_oc=AdqVFMZNc3PoUH5wqMlrxMGNa1xMvstrwkjGLXpVRYxbVZ7ip2ixK2sN0WTB8HehBzM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-BFv7e70Y9ULqMqyc0NVh8EKiIXSSppwCUib1Wa4SwGw&oe=6A3960C2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape.png", "id": "1443952479413837", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_1443952486080503_3476958366015208444_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pVuSRmbZfYAQ7kNvwFL9mUd&_nc_oc=AdqaLOEEHWyMPVVrA09G-GeZO76p7NLsNS8ZL3L5eeezD2NnuiTazNVND-L-BaD4v0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9s9JG7sPOfobv5juxkFqS1rai2vaAA-tg50EPZBFwmuQ&oe=6A39336F"}, "display_name": "3D scan of Collonges-la-Rouge", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Move like a pedestrian in Collonges-la-Rouge, reconstructed from videos taken by two head-held 360 cameras (Gopro Max), whose trajectory is about 1.6km long.\n\nRight controller:\n- Rotate on the left or right by using the joystick\n- Update the vertical offset (up or down) by using the joystick\n- Choose a location and teleport to it by using the virtual laser pointer\n- Teleport by using the index trigger only if the laser is green (not red)\n\nLeft controller:\n- Move continuously by using the joystick\n- Switch pannel and map by using the grip/hand trigger\n- If both map and pannel are disabled, switch between rendering modes (texturing or normal colors) by pressing the index trigger\n- The map shows the cloud of mesh vertices and the user location\n- If the pannel is enabled, switch between constrained and unconstrained motions by pressing the index trigger\n- The constrained motion controls your height above the ground\n- The pannel shows information about the 3D model and the selected motion.\n", "short_description": "Move continuously like a pedestrian in a medieval town, which was computed by photogrammetry from cubemap videos (4096x1344x2) taken by two head-held 360 cameras (Gopro Max) and by walking about 1.6km in Collonges-la-Rouge (in France).\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Maxime Lhuillier", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity 2019.4", "support_website_url": "http://maxime.lhuillier.free.fr/", "website_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "co